「手垢のついたことしか言わない彼女」遊ぶのじゃ
Playing "The Girlfriend Who Only Says Cliché Things."

1067
02:00:26,702 --> 02:00:31,122
Twitterの方とかでお知らせもするのでお楽しみに。
I'll announce it on Twitter and stuff, so look forward to it.

1068
